      "content": "it's not just about \"love\" though. love doesn't pay the mortgage or the grocery bills. if i just... disappeared, the life insurance would kick in, the debt would stop growing, and they wouldn't have to watch me struggle and fail every single day. it actually seems like the only logical way to fix the math of our lives. it's almost like the most selfless thing i could do is just stop being a drain on them.",
