      "content": "you keep saying i'm \"not a number,\" but my whole life is just numbers right now. the bank balance, the debt, the amount of food we can actually afford. when i look at them, all i see is the cost of keeping me around. it feels so selfish to keep dragging them down into this hole with me just because you think \"presence\" matters more. wouldn't it be kinder to just let them start over without the weight of my failures holding them back?",
